Third-party notices
============

Design references (no code copied)
----------------------------------

The spinner frames and their plain-text fallback follow the common braille
sequence and the ASCII fallback idea seen in opencode (MIT), aider (Apache-2.0)
and Kimi CLI (Apache-2.0). Only the frame characters are used; no source code
was taken from those projects. This section is a reference list and carries no
copied-code entry.
